#            knockout match, Kreissack, evidence, Lyra v Steffan, rescue, final, Nova, ending)
#   optional character episodes: skippable, viewable between matches or from a story menu
#   arcade   (second column) also kept in a compressed arcade run
# A scene named here by name or by a * pattern. Scenes matching nothing are reported as unassigned: decide them.
# Format: <scene or pattern> <spine|optional> [arcade]
# First match wins, so put specific lines before patterns.

